### Create Workflow while Kafka is down
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/workflows
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "templateId": "VENDOR_ONBOARDING",
  "requesterId": "usr_ashish_01",
  "title": "Kafka Failure Resiliency Test 2"
}

### Verify CQRS Projection in Analytics Service
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/analytics/workflows/6617deac-76dc-4599-ab42-3bf60d6273ef

### Replay all quarantined events after recovering Kafka
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/admin/outbox/replay-failed

### Or replay a single event by ID
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/admin/outbox/events/6617deac-76dc-4599-ab42-3bf60d6273ef/replay